<title>AUSTRALIA: ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 11.</title>
<headline>ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 11.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>N.M. Rothschild &amp; Sons (Australia) Pty Ltd ceased to be a substantial shareholder in Hills Motorway Group on 07/04/1997.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>N.M. Rothschild &amp; Sons (Australia) Pty Ltd ceased to be a substantial shareholder in Western Metals Limited on 07/04/1997.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
</text>
